{"seq":1,"slug":"why-tropical","title":"为何热带几何","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/why-tropical","wordCount":1675,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何热带几何\">为何热带几何</h1><p>一条抛物线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = x^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是光滑的、连续弯曲的；但如果你把它「热带化」，它会瞬间变成两条从一个折点射出的直线段。丢掉了曲率，换来了什么？答案是：几乎所有你关心的离散不变量——次数、亏格、交点数——都被这张折线图原样保留了下来，而计算它们的代价从「解代数方程」降到了「画折线、数顶点」。热带几何这门学科的全部魅力，就藏在这个「用分段线性骨架换取组合可计算性」的交易里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇是入门定位篇，先把贯穿全 hub 的几个核心对象讲清楚，后续各章都在它们之上展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>热带半环</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\min,+)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\max,+)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：把经典乘法换成加法、经典加法换成取极值的代数系统，是整门学科的运算基座。</li>\n<li><strong>热带化（退化）</strong>：在指数层面观察一族随参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\to0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的正数，乘法变加法、加法变主导项，从而把一个光滑对象压成分段线性骨架。</li>\n<li><strong>分段线性骨架</strong>：热带化后得到的折线与多面体复形，用折面代替曲面、折线代替曲线。</li>\n<li><strong>不变量保持</strong>：次数、亏格、交点数等离散不变量在这张骨架上原样保留，是热带方法可用的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一个古怪名字的来历\">一个古怪名字的来历</h2><p>「热带」（tropical）与气候、地理毫无关系，也不描述任何几何形状。这个词来自 1980 年代，法国数学家 Dominique Perrin、Jean-Éric Pin 等人为纪念巴西计算机科学家 Imre Simon 而起。Simon 在自动机理论中研究了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\min, +)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 半环上的矩阵问题，法国同行便把这套代数戏称为「tropical」——因为巴西地处热带。名字后来随着 2000 年代 Sturmfels、Speyer、Mikhalkin 等人把它系统化为代数几何的一支而固定下来。</p>\n<p>理解这段历史有个实际好处：它提醒你热带几何有两个血统。一支来自<strong>理论计算机科学与最优化</strong>（min-plus 半环、最短路、调度），另一支来自<strong>代数几何</strong>（曲线、簇、赋值）。这两支在 hub 里分别对应<a href=\"../practice/optimization-scheduling\">应用</a>章的调度与<a href=\"../curves/tropical-curves\">曲线</a>章的几何，它们最终在<a href=\"../theory/fundamental-theorem\">基本定理</a>处汇合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"退化-把乘法拍扁成加法\">退化：把乘法拍扁成加法</h2><p>热带几何的核心操作是一次「退化」。考虑一族依赖参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的正数，写成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{-a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当我们把两个这样的数相乘，指数相加：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{-a}\\cdot t^{-b} = t^{-(a+b)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。当我们把它们相加，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t\\to 0^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时较大的那个（指数更负的）主导：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><mo>≈</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{-a} + t^{-b} \\approx t^{-\\max(a,b)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8547em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。于是在「指数层面」，经典的乘法变成了加法，经典的加法变成了取最大。这正是 max-plus 半环。取一个符号翻转（用赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{val}(t^a)=a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">val</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>）就得到对偶的 min-plus 版本。</p>\n<p>下面这张表把三套算术并排，能一眼看出热带几何在做什么样的字典翻译：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>经典代数</th>\n<th>max-plus 热带</th>\n<th>直观含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\times b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>指数相加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a + b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max(a,b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>主导项胜出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘法单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^0=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加法单位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t^{-\\infty}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多项式</td>\n<td>分段线性凸函数</td>\n<td>折线代替曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代数簇</td>\n<td>多面体复形</td>\n<td>折面代替曲面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套字典的形式化机制——赋值、Puiseux 级数、Maslov 反量子化——是<a href=\"tropicalization\">热带化</a>一篇的主题；而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊕</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\otimes</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊗</span></span></span></span></span> 满足哪些公理、又缺哪些公理，是 <a href=\"min-plus-semiring\">min-plus 半环</a> 的主题。本篇只需你接受这个交易本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"丢了什么-换了什么\">丢了什么，换了什么</h2><p>任何简化都有代价。热带化丢掉的是<strong>连续的、微分层面的信息</strong>：曲率、切线的连续变化、复解析结构统统消失。换来的是三样东西。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>可计算性</strong>。求两条平面代数曲线的交点，经典做法要解一个多项式方程组；热带做法是把两张折线图叠在一起，数它们相交的点。Bernd Sturmfels 常用的比喻是：热带几何是「代数几何的组合影子」，影子丢了立体感，却能直接用尺子量。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>不变量的保持</strong>。Grigory Mikhalkin 在 2005 年的对应定理（Correspondence Theorem）证明：平面上满足给定条件的代数曲线的计数，等于对应热带曲线的加权计数。这意味着一个纯粹枚举几何的难题，可以翻译成一个组合计数问题来解——这是热带方法第一次在主流代数几何里赢得声誉。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>新对象的可视化</strong>。某些经典对象（如高维簇、模空间）本身难以想象，但它们的热带化是实心的多面体复形，可以画出来、可以用 <a href=\"../../computational-geometry/convex-triangulation/convex-hull\">39_computational-geometry</a> 的凸包算法处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;经典对象&lt;br/&gt;代数曲线 / 簇&quot;] --&gt;|赋值 val / t→0| B[&quot;热带化&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;分段线性对象&lt;br/&gt;折线 / 多面体复形&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;组合计算&lt;br/&gt;数顶点 / 数交点&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E[&quot;保持的不变量&lt;br/&gt;次数 · 亏格 · 交点数&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;把代数几何难题&lt;br/&gt;翻译成组合问题&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[\"经典对象&lt;br/&gt;代数曲线 / 簇\"] --&gt;|赋值 val / t→0| B[\"热带化\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"分段线性对象&lt;br/&gt;折线 / 多面体复形\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"组合计算&lt;br/&gt;数顶点 / 数交点\"]\n  C --&gt; E[\"保持的不变量&lt;br/&gt;次数 · 亏格 · 交点数\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"把代数几何难题&lt;br/&gt;翻译成组合问题\"]\n  E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"为什么值得单独学它\">为什么值得单独学它</h2><p>有人会问：如果热带几何只是代数几何的影子，为什么不直接学代数几何？三个理由。</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>影子有时比本体更容易抓住</strong>。枚举几何里的 Gromov–Witten 不变量、Hurwitz 数等，用热带方法给出的证明往往更短更组合化。其二，<strong>它自带一片独立的应用天地</strong>。系统发生学里的树空间恰好是热带线性空间（见<a href=\"../practice/phylogenetics\">系统发生学</a>），离散事件系统的动力学恰好是 max-plus 线性的（见<a href=\"../practice/optimization-scheduling\">优化与调度</a>），这些应用并不需要你懂经典代数几何。其三，<strong>它和最优化深度同构</strong>。热带半环上的「线性代数」本质上就是最短路与线性规划的对偶结构，这让它与 <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/convex-sets\">05_optimization-theory</a> 的凸分析血脉相连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>热带几何用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\min,+)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\max,+)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 半环，把经典代数几何的弯曲对象「退化」成分段线性的折线与多面体复形。</li>\n<li>「热带」之名源自纪念巴西学者 Imre Simon，无关几何形状；这门学科有最优化与代数几何双重血统。</li>\n<li>退化的机制是：在指数层面，乘法变加法、加法变取极值；代价是丢掉微分信息，收益是组合可计算性与不变量的保持。</li>\n<li>Mikhalkin 的对应定理是热带方法在主流数学中站稳脚跟的标志性成果。</li>\n<li>值得单独学，因为它既能简化经典证明，又自带系统发生、调度、机器学习等独立应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>下一步：把这套算术的公理讲清楚 → <a href=\"min-plus-semiring\">min-plus 半环</a></li>\n<li>退化的形式化机制 → <a href=\"tropicalization\">热带化</a></li>\n<li>影子如何变成几何图形 → <a href=\"../curves/tropical-curves\">热带曲线</a></li>\n<li>跨库：热带半环与经典凸分析的关系 → <a href=\"../../optimization-theory/convex-optimization/convex-sets\">05_optimization-theory 凸集</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何热带几何","id":"为何热带几何"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一个古怪名字的来历","id":"一个古怪名字的来历"},{"level":2,"text":"退化：把乘法拍扁成加法","id":"退化-把乘法拍扁成加法"},{"level":2,"text":"丢了什么，换了什么","id":"丢了什么-换了什么"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么值得单独学它","id":"为什么值得单独学它"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"min-plus 半环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/min-plus-semiring"}}